msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: badend5:badend5_5D7A5D26_0D02_4F27_98DD_7C5277A389E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37f0205c6f4914080882034d787fd7ce7012ddda0bfbf8ba73c7f57eddeb94f9
#. default-sha256: f8a2de2e13209df349855224901ca9567a767bfd61e11d4a131c1dc0e5077841
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_5D7A5D26_0D02_4F27_98DD_7C5277A389E1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Farewell, Michel.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Until our souls cross paths once more⟪k:3⟫in the boundless sphere "
"of fate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Прощай, Мишель.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫До той поры, пока наши души не встретятся вновь ⟪k:3⟫по велению "
"судьбы."

